  "name": "Make, let and help",
  "level": "B1",
  "status": "geprueft",
  "subtitle": "After make, let and help, use the base verb without to: My boss makes us work late. My parents let me stay out. She helped me carry the bags. Use to only in the passive: We were made to wait.",
